{"name": "Illusionary Manor", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Illusionary Manor</strong> is a 3D first-person adventure puzzle game where the player will explore a magical mansion filled with paintings from all corners of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Michele, a young artist kidnapped from his own wedding and brought to a mysterious manor filled with paintings \u2014 a place where art is alive. To escape, you must step inside the broken paintings, interact with their worlds, solve puzzles, and uncover secrets that were never meant to be found.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"73\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/5ad58a35b0cfb488391333d033027f52.avif?t=1790682472\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"298\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/0616507da8bc3a2ba5873e1e404383dc.poster.avif?t=1790682472\" width=\"900\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/0616507da8bc3a2ba5873e1e404383dc.webm?t=1790682472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/0616507da8bc3a2ba5873e1e404383dc.mp4?t=1790682472\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter legendary works of art \u2014 each painting is a living, breathing world with its own rules, atmosphere, and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"74\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/645dcc05c51237471c5dfd60c8d6c3b5.avif?t=1790682472\" width=\"791\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"298\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/64ffc4d2c4bf9044d0a27a89d4db3d64.poster.avif?t=1790682472\" width=\"900\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/64ffc4d2c4bf9044d0a27a89d4db3d64.webm?t=1790682472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/64ffc4d2c4bf9044d0a27a89d4db3d64.mp4?t=1790682472\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Original characters with unique personalities and side quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Handcrafted puzzles inspired by classical artworks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A magical world where art comes alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/43e9f47e05eda43cbdfdde964db1f666.webp?t=1790682472\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"298\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/fbd3d28751fcd0341115cc08386ec306.poster.avif?t=1790682472\" width=\"900\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/fbd3d28751fcd0341115cc08386ec306.webm?t=1790682472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/fbd3d28751fcd0341115cc08386ec306.mp4?t=1790682472\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with surreal environments, uncover hidden mechanics, and use logic and observation to restore balance within each painting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"73\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/d0940e3cba1c5f02df48055fc952bf14.avif?t=1790682472\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"298\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/5bdded0156a8547f02fa438a3144a550.poster.avif?t=1790682472\" width=\"900\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/5bdded0156a8547f02fa438a3144a550.webm?t=1790682472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/5bdded0156a8547f02fa438a3144a550.mp4?t=1790682472\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every restored painting unlocks new parts of the Illusionary Manor and gives you new ways to interact with the mansion around you. Explore a nonlinear mansion, revisit familiar rooms from a new perspective, uncover the hidden story of this place, and face the personal struggles buried beneath the search for escape.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"73\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/3e138bf224a5a35ff2a8cba1cc037f33.avif?t=1790682472\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"298\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/35d4b42369ff99f1f7cc8529347f2d6f.poster.avif?t=1790682472\" width=\"900\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/35d4b42369ff99f1f7cc8529347f2d6f.webm?t=1790682472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/extras/35d4b42369ff99f1f7cc8529347f2d6f.mp4?t=1790682472\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet and assist the living spirits of the manor \u2014 each with their own secrets, manners, and reasons to stay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Boozy</strong>, a refined owl with a sharp tongue, is always nearby in a noble posture.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jestario</strong>, a graceful painted shadow and the manor\u2019s guardian, smiles politely while hiding far more than he says.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Other strange inhabitants</strong>, each with their own troubles to solve, stories to share, and reasons to follow you deeper into the manor.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn their stories, earn their trust, and discover what truly keeps the Illusionary Manor alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Have you ever dreamed of being inside the paintings of great artists? Change them? Illusionary Manor is waiting for you. Explore a mysterious manor where every painting leads to a new world. Solve puzzles, uncover secrets, and discover the story behind the art.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4474360/7262e85fb163645ae03bb0f22d80a26c20207338/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1790682472", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Adventure", "Puzzle", "First-Person", "Exploration", "Atmospheric", "Singleplayer"], "developers": "ALAMID Games", "publishers": "ALAMID Games", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4474360", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "24 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/3w_I94HPyJU", "first_seen": 1792792800.0, "review_rank": 8}